# oracle: cut-down peptide (84 protein atoms of examples/PACKAGES/ilves/data.peptide, renumbered, no water) with fix ilves on the bonds of types 4 6 8 10 12 14 18 and the angles of type 31 (as in in.peptide-ilves), fix nve for 50 steps: thermo and every per-atom position, velocity and force (fix nvt is not used here: its first thermostat update differs from native, see the fix ilves header)
# oracle-inputs: w50il_peptide.data
# oracle-compare: thermo=all atoms=all rel=1e-7 abs=1e-9
units           real
atom_style      full
pair_style      lj/charmm/coul/long 8.0 10.0 10.0
bond_style      harmonic
angle_style     charmm
dihedral_style  charmm
improper_style  harmonic
kspace_style    pppm 0.0001
read_data       w50il_peptide.data
neighbor        2.0 bin
neigh_modify    delay 5
timestep        2.0
thermo_style    custom step temp pe ebond eangle evdwl ecoul elong press
thermo_modify   format float %.15g
thermo          10
fix             1 all nve
fix             cstr all ilves 0.0001 150 100 b 4 6 8 10 12 14 18 a 31
run             50
